@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：RocketMQ 普通消息发送与消费

participant MessageTemplate
participant RocketMqMessageProvider as Provider
participant RocketMQProducer as Producer
queue RocketMQBroker as Broker
participant PushConsumer
participant CoreListener

== 发送 ==
MessageTemplate -> Provider: send(request)
Provider -> Provider: setTopic / setBody / properties
opt messageKey 存在
  Provider -> Provider: setKeys(messageKey)
end
Provider -> Producer: sendAsync(message)
Producer -> Broker: publish
Broker --> Producer: SendReceipt / error
Producer --> Provider: completion
Provider --> MessageTemplate: CONFIRMED / REJECTED / FAILED / UNKNOWN

== 消费 ==
Broker -> PushConsumer: MessageView
PushConsumer -> Provider: listener(messageView)
Provider -> Provider: body + properties + first key
Provider -> CoreListener: onMessage(inbound)
alt SUCCESS
  CoreListener --> Provider: SUCCESS
  Provider --> PushConsumer: ConsumeResult.SUCCESS
else RETRY / exception
  CoreListener --> Provider: RETRY
  Provider --> PushConsumer: ConsumeResult.FAILURE
end

note over Provider
messageKey 只映射 RocketMQ Keys 用于检索。
FIFO 顺序的 MessageGroup 属于三期独立能力。
end note
@enduml
